["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"On $L^p$ Density of Self-Similar Measures and Continuous Bernoulli Convolutions - Constantin Kogler self-similar measure Bernoulli convolution absolutely continuous L^p density Lean\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-instituteforad-ai-半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e280b6f6fbcbd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 半小時證出人類一年沒做出的數學定理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個被卡住的 L^p 問題，AI 用半小時給出五頁證明，把 60 頁的論文壓縮成核心引理，還順手把連續密度的門檻從 588 推到 9。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 證明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Looney Tunes animator Chuck Jones / Remembering singer Cassandra Wilson yes session scatting Acme Corporation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-freshair-乐一通-动画师-角色不是画出来的-是想出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b48c92c9b28c25a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>《樂一通》動畫師：角色不是畫出來的，是想出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chuck Jones 說動畫的關鍵不是角色長什麼樣、怎麼畫，而是「他是誰」——他先理解角色，才讓 Daffy 同時怯懦又跋扈，讓兔八哥必須先被招惹才反擊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">動畫</span><span class=\"tag\">角色設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Bollywood Dreams IIT third assistant director catfishing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-searchengine-他汇款30万美元拍宝莱坞-买的不是电影-是被人尊重的感觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09ff12606d9630c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Search Engine</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>他匯款30萬美元拍寶萊塢，買的不是電影，是被人尊重的感覺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兒子以為父親把30萬美元匯給了印度的騙子導演。記者到孟買片場看了整整一天，發現老人清楚自己在買什麼：一個所有人都要聽他的房間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">寶萊塢</span><span class=\"tag\">跨境匯款</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The last IMO problem AI could not solve Lean Erdős-Szekeres theorem motivated explanation LIS / LDS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-karpathy-ai-解不出的最后一道-imo-题-价值不在答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a156d48d62c56e56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 解不出的最後一道 IMO 題，價值不在答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2025 年 IMO 第六題只有不到 1% 的選手拿滿分，所有 AI 都卡在這題上。它難的不是計算，是必須先理解、先有審美，再動筆——而這恰恰是強化學習最難訓練的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 與數學</span><span class=\"tag\">IMO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Isaacman: A New Era for NASA and American Space Exploration NEP MMRTG closed Brayton cycle TRL in-situ resource utilization\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-allin-nasa-局长-我们不是采购机构-是核动力-nasa/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/432889fb9b668f60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>NASA 局長：我們不是採購機構，是核動力 NASA</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Isaacman 說 NASA 過去把資源攤到每個選區、為合作而合作，結果月球火箭效率不如土星五號；他要做的是核動力與核推進，把近地軌道交給 SpaceX 這類公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">核動力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Trying to Save the World Is No Excuse John Doe delta hedge BDC target date fund\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-moneystuff-想拯救世界-不是搞垄断协议的借口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>想拯救世界，不是搞壟斷協議的藉口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 實驗室想聯手放慢模型開發，但四家巨頭坐下來談減速，法律上就是教科書式的反壟斷合謀——想拯救世界不構成抗辯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 競賽</span><span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of Startups in 2026 harness RL environments codegen system of record egocentric data\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-ycsp-硬科技占-yc-批次两成-软件公司正在被智能体吃掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9835cc1816c0414b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">36:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>硬科技佔 YC 批次兩成：軟件公司正在被智能體吃掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">YC 最新批次裡硬科技公司從 8% 漲到 20%，機器人、國防、半導體、電力全線翻倍；同時軟件公司從賣工具轉向賣「把活幹完」，中位收入從 8K 漲到 20K。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Sweetest Thing potency volatiles optogenetics erythrolose\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-radiolab-最甜的东西可能不是糖-而是照进脑子的一束光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/97fefade0b968e40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">31:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>最甜的東西可能不是糖，而是照進腦子的一束光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">按「甜度」排名，糖並不是最甜的；但按你實際嚐到的甜，糖幾乎無法被超越。更顛覆的是，用激光直接點亮甜味神經元，理論上能造出人類從未嘗過的甜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">味覺</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E252 公積金新規來了，這筆錢該怎麼用？這份行動清單供你參考 轉移支付 職業年金 個人養老金\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-zhixing-公积金新规-能取则取-但别把它当存款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0641b913c2f67c2e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>公積金新規：能取則取，但別把它當存款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公積金不是隨時能取的存款，虛假提取會被追責且三年內不能再取；但新規把租房提到提取首位、取消房租佔收入比例限制，該取的錢還是該取。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公積金</span><span class=\"tag\">房地產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A.I. Safety Goes Mainstream + a ‘Hard Fork’ Exit AMA PDOOM embedded evaluators base model finishing school low concept\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-hardfork-ai-高管集体求监管-连加速派也开始发怵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 高管集體求監管：連加速派也開始發怵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario Amodei 呼籲在 AI 公司內部派駐常駐評估員，Altman、Musk、Hassabis 跟進——平時幾乎什麼都不同意的競爭對手，第一次公開說出私下說了多年的話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"CLARITY Failed, Many Stablecoins Debate, Circle Launches Arc &amp; Meta&#x27;s AI Edge | Weekly Roundup TSVS NMS stock transfer agent DAT CPN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-empire-稳定币不是双寡头-大公司要发自己的币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d849bf677b8fa83d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>穩定幣不是雙寡頭：大公司要發自己的幣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多穩定幣論戰迴歸：Rob 說他知道有跨國公司正在發自己的穩定幣，Circle 的 USDC 網絡效應被低估，但利率降到 2-3% 時它的收入會腰斬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">穩定幣</span><span class=\"tag\">代幣化證券</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Fed Is Hiking Into A Growth Slowdown | Weekly Roundup terms of trade R minus G regulatory capture SPR dot plot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-forwardguidanc-美联储加息撞上增长放缓-欧洲要重走日本贬值老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/446b9f7d49819e61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Forward Guidance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美聯儲加息撞上增長放緩，歐洲要重走日本貶值老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲在增長見頂時啟動加息，而過去一年撐住美國消費的三四千億美元「隱形中期刺激」正在退潮；Vincent Deluard 認為歐洲今天的處境就是 2012 年的日本，最終只能靠貨幣貶值解決。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span><span class=\"tag\">滯脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"687. Are Prediction Markets the Best Forecasting Tool Ever — or Just Another Casino? prediction market CFTC self-certification MNPI KYC decision market\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-freakonomics-预测市场不是赌场-但九成交易量来自体育/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>預測市場不是賭場，但九成交易量來自體育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 用四年合規換來九成市場份額，但它的收入結構更像博彩公司；真正被低估的是 FDA 審批這類安靜市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">預測市場</span><span class=\"tag\">監管合規</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Diffusion Will Win AI Inference with Inception Co-Founder and CEO Stefano Ermon diffusion model autoregressive model perplexity serving engine RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-nopriors-扩散模型不是图像专利-它要在推理时赢下语言模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d0b6b28d73eac46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>擴散模型不是圖像專利，它要在推理時贏下語言模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">自迴歸推理必須一個 token 一個 token 順序生成，是內存帶寬瓶頸；擴散模型一次並行處理多個 token，推理負載更像訓練，所以 Inception 押它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">擴散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理效率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Sibling Fights: When to Step In (and When to Stay Out) sportscaster mode emotion coaching glass child\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-raisinggh-孩子打架时-当证人别当法官/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/128bd49e9267d192-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">38:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架時，當證人別當法官</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公平不等於平等：給每個孩子他需要的，而不是一模一樣的東西。父母要做的不是裁決誰對誰錯，而是描述發生了什麼，讓他們自己找到下一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">兄弟姐妹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s a Mind-Boggling Number of Rich People in America pass-through S-Corp search fund LBO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-oddlots-美国最富的一群人-藏在小生意里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美國最富的一群人，藏在小生意裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國收入不平等加劇的一半來自 pass-through 企業收入，而這類企業主不是科技巨頭，是汽車經銷商、啤酒分銷商、牙醫和賣熱狗的——他們被當成「小企業」保護了四十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">稅收</span><span class=\"tag\">財富不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"OpenAI&#x27;s waiting game, gas pump pain, and severe sulfur strain! confidential S1 counterfactual metric ton\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-indicator-openai-不上市的理由是安全-你信吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 不上市的理由是安全，你信嗎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Altman 說現在上市「不明智」，理由是安全；但同一時間 OpenAI 在談 1.2 萬億美元融資，CFO 卻被排除在投資人會議之外。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #18: Hair Relaxer creamy crack lye conk HBCU uterine fibroids\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-ninepi-直发剂让黑人女性变美-也让她们付出健康代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac66d20d6cb97253-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>直髮劑讓黑人女性變美，也讓她們付出健康代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化學直髮劑既建起了黑人社區最早的百萬富翁產業，也被研究指向子宮癌風險升高——同一件產品同時是經濟階梯和身體代價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費史</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How a Broken Arm Improved my French - with David Epstein mere urgency effect pre-registration HARKing replication crisis Hemingway principle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-cautionary-断臂逼出的法语满分-限制才是创造力的引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>斷臂逼出的法語滿分：限制才是創造力的引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Epstein 摔斷手臂後被迫用圖像記憶代替速記，法語反而考滿分；倫敦地鐵罷工兩天，很多人找到了更好的通勤路線。限制不是障礙，是逼你實驗的開關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創造力</span><span class=\"tag\">限制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Shirley: Exposing Government Fraud, Suing California &amp; Taking on the Media immigration support service providers AB2624 / Stop Nick Shirley Act change order delays SNAP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-allin-加州为了让一个-24-岁博主闭嘴-专门立了一部法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51224d453a524a2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>加州為了讓一個 24 歲博主閉嘴，專門立了一部法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州對調查者的反擊不是否認，而是立法：他一旦上傳拍到的畫面，先罰 4000 美元，再賠對方律師費。提出這部法的，是這個州總檢察長的妻子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加州高鐵</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"238. 特斯拉之後，汽車行業改變的不是動力，而是一整套遊戲規則丨串臺「Freda下午茶」 D2C DMS global consistency Tier 1 / Tier 2 VinFast\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-beiwanglu-特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动-而是重写了汽车业游戏规则/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"貝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">貝望錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉真正的顛覆不是電動，而是重寫了汽車業遊戲規則</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統車企不是沒看到特斯拉，而是把它當成細分市場的新玩具；真正被顛覆的是七年一改款的節奏、經銷商體系和供應鏈利益，這些包袱讓它們轉不了身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車出海</span><span class=\"tag\">新能源汽車</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"外灘大會線下圓桌｜敢把錢包交給AI嗎？聊聊Agent交易爆發前夜的信任基建 KYA Agentic Commerce Harness A2A Superbloom\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-sv101-把钱包交给-ai-之前-支付网络得先重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">35:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把錢包交給 AI 之前，支付網絡得先重寫一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四位嘉賓裡只有一位真的用 Agent 付過錢，花了 40 多塊。萬事達卡說真正的卡點不在技術，而在讓普通消費者發自內心願意相信一個智能體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體支付</span><span class=\"tag\">信任基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Exxon’s Office Fling Jersey Standard dedicated word processor Directly Reduced Iron (DRI)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-asianometry-石油巨头去做打字机-做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f647fbb2223b0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>石油巨頭去做打字機，做到施樂那麼大也只是桶裡一滴油</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1978 年埃克森把文字處理器、智能打字機和傳真機合併成 Exxon Information Systems，去挑戰 IBM。它輸掉的不是技術，而是自己的體量：做到施樂那麼大，也只等於桶裡一滴油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業史</span><span class=\"tag\">多元化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"300 高市早苗支持率高位橫盤 內閣改組政壇進入多事之秋 Middle Power Japan&#x27;s back 中道\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-eastasia-冲绳变天不是亲中派落败-是年轻人认命要实惠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>沖繩變天不是親中派落敗，是年輕人認命要實惠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沖繩知事選舉，反對美軍基地的一方執政近二十年後敗選。這不是左右轉向，也不是對華態度變了：抗爭幾十年基地一步沒動，年輕選民認了命，先要眼前的經濟實惠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本政治</span><span class=\"tag\">高市早苗</span>\n</div></div></a>"]